Pb206 proton general purpose library                              8231 1451   13
                                                                  8231 1451   14
Author: A.J. Koning, IAEA                                         8231 1451   15
                                                                  8231 1451   16
Ref.: A.J. Koning and D. Rochman,                                 8231 1451   17
